OL,3,ASix thousand Italian schools hit by
OL,4,Athreats in suspected bomb hoax
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome 6,300 schools across Italy have
OL,7,Freceived bomb threats, according to
OL,8,Fgovernment in Rome, and Education
OL,9,FMinister Giuseppe Valditara has said
OL,10,Fthe incidents are probably a
OL,11,F"cyber-attack, not a genuine risk".
OL,13,FValditara told Italian TV that there
OL,14,Fwas a clear strategy behind the rash of
OL,15,Fthreats in Italy and elsewhere in
OL,16,FEurope which had targeted flights,
OL,17,Fsupermarkets and even hospitals.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
